		{
			dependencies: ["4532D8D7E4963F89"]
			description: [
				"to level up you need to place a Stone Altar with 4 Stone Altar Fire Bowls (in a 3 block radius). You must lit the fire bowls with a torch or flint and steel. After that you can insert Liver \\& Cracked Bones into the altar. To start the ritual you must right-click the altar with Flint \\& Steel or a (Soul) Torch."
				"For level 2, 3 livers and 2 cracked bones are required, and you must have killed 50 mobs."
			]
			id: "65D60C5290E5786B"
