		{
			dependencies: ["034DBB22E2907A5E"]
			description: [
				"While you grow stronger, you'll come across options with two choosable skills. These skills are &oexclusive&r and you can only choose one."
				"At level 4, your skill tree opens up to 3 paths, these being &oBeast, Survivalist, and Human, focusing on combat, movement, and utilities respectively. While not exclusive, later skills such as forms cost more points, so be sure to think over your choices. &oYou cannot easily reset your perks.&r"
