		{
			dependencies: ["1FED017AF22E96E9"]
			description: [
				"&o&4Faction controlled villages&r are protected and occupied by one of the three factions. While exploring, you may find a village already with a fragile totem. If not, you can make a base and head yourself."
				"When claimed by a faction, all workstations and beds will be claimed by that faction. Right clicking a village totem not belonging to you will start &oa raid&r wherein the attacking faction will begin spawning and must be fought off by the defending faction. Raids can also occur randomly, or by entering a village with the Bad Omen effect from another faction."
			]
