		{
			dependencies: ["1BC30C22E89D0830"]
			description: ["Once you've become a lord, you can get a minion. &oYou can only have a number of minions equal to your lord level.&r To recruit a minion, find a weak werewolf npc and interact with them holding a Moon Charm. Moon charms are received as rewards for completing the task, &o\"Minion Control.\"&r"]
