		{
			dependencies: ["1C7B5C5AA9263D78"]
			description: [
				"Interacting with minions shows their inventory menu and accessory slots. From there you can order them to follow you, defend you, Defend the area, Stay, or Collect resources. Alternatively, you can edit their appearance and lock them from accepting global commands, which you can do by accessing the command menu (default R)"
				""
				"Minions start out weak, but can grow stronger with the usage of more enhanced moon charms. The tasks required to obtain these charms become available as you level up in your lord status."
			]
			id: "4A73DC6507969015"
			tasks: [{
				id: "100DA68D4F055013"
