		{
			dependencies: ["143F22ADA2229BF4"]
			description: ["Once you've hit max level at 14, you can start to increase your age rank. You can do this by killing mobs with your bite attack. To check your progress on increasing your rank, interact with the stone altar fire bowls. As your age increases, you get more bite strength, damage, health, time to spend in your werewolf form during the day, and healing from your bite attack. However, you will also take more damage from silver oil and hunters, as well as having harsher prices from villagers."]
